// Wave data for Maze Command.
//
// Waves 1 to 35 come from the System TD map, converted for one player.
// From wave 36 onwards waves are generated by TD.generateWave() below.
//
// Fields:
//   name    enemy name shown at the start of the wave
//   hp      hit points per enemy
//   armour  armour value (see TD.armourFactor)
//   speed   cells per second
//   count   number of enemies in the wave
//   flying  flying enemies ignore the maze and fly straight to the exit
//   gold    gold per kill
//   boss    true for a single big enemy

